PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, and January to February in 38. In 2025 the middle saw June to July at 231% of normal and November to December at 31%. Every grid had its driest year in 1956, with grid 20232 at 48% of normal.</p>"}
